  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.1: the binaries in the package are Authenticode-signed by TroBeeONE LLC. No other changes. 0.2.0: daffy.transfer - copy a table from the connection you are on into a new #temp table on another of your connections, streamed server to server as a bulk load; all or nothing, and Stop leaves nothing behind. 0.1.0: first release. One client connection, up to three SQL Server connections; daffy.connect, daffy.status and daffy.help for everyone; connections, logins and grants managed in T-SQL by admins; pooled connections reset to their default connection.",
